AltoERC4626RatioChainlinkOracle::updateERC4626RatioNode()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── when _erc4626RatioNode is valid
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when _erc4626RatioNode contains invalid node
    │   ├── when node initialRatio is zero
    │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleERC4626RatioInvalidInput
    │   ├── when node initialTimestamp is greater than block.timestamp
    │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleERC4626RatioInvalidInput
    │   └── when node maxYearlyGrowthRatioWad is zero
    │       └── it should revert with ModuleERC4626RatioInvalidInput
    └── when _erc4626RatioNode is valid
        ├── it should emit SetERC4626RatioNode event with old and new nodes
        ├── it should replace existing erc4626RatioNode
        └── it should update erc4626RatioNode correctly

